@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 3 (US 4.1.10 – Search VVEs with Metrics)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
	ArrowColor Black
	ActorBorderColor #000000
	ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	LifeLineBorderColor Black
	LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantBorderColor Black
	ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "«container (C4)»\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nVesselVisitExecutionsController" as VVE_CTRL #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nVesselVisitExecutionService" as VVE_SVC #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nIVesselVisitExecutionRepository" as VVE_REPO #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nPort Logistics API Client" as PL_CLIENT #87CEEB
participant "«external»\nIAM" as IAM #F5F5DC

-> UI: 1: request to search VVEs
activate UI
UI -> IAM: 1.1: validate token
activate IAM
IAM --> UI: 1.1.1: token valid
deactivate IAM
UI --> : 1.2: display search form
deactivate UI

-> UI: 2: provide search criteria (date range, vessel, status)
activate UI

UI -> VVE_CTRL: 2.1: GET /api/vesselvisitexecutions/search?startDate=X&endDate=Y&vesselImo=Z&status=S
activate VVE_CTRL

VVE_CTRL -> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1: SearchWithMetricsAsync(startDate, endDate, vesselImo, status)
activate VVE_SVC

VVE_SVC -> VVE_REPO: 2.1.1.1: GetFilteredAsync(filters)
activate VVE_REPO
VVE_REPO --> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1.2: list of VVEs
deactivate VVE_REPO

loop for each VVE
    VVE_SVC -> PL_CLIENT: 2.1.1.3: GET /api/vesselvisitnotifications/{vvnId}
    activate PL_CLIENT
    PL_CLIENT --> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1.4: VVN details (expected times, vessel info)
    deactivate PL_CLIENT
    
    VVE_SVC -> VVE_SVC: 2.1.1.5: CalculateMetrics()
    note right
        Calculate:
        - Turnaround Time (TAT)
        - Berth Occupancy Time
        - Waiting Time for Berthing
        - Arrival Delay
        - Departure Delay
        - Executed Operations Count
    end note
end

VVE_SVC --> VVE_CTRL: 2.1.2: List<VesselVisitExecutionSearchResultDTO>
deactivate VVE_SVC

VVE_CTRL --> UI: 2.2: 200 OK (VVEs with metrics)
deactivate VVE_CTRL

UI --> : 2.3: display tabular/timeline view with metrics
deactivate UI

@enduml
